{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Mannequin: Factory</i>, you play as a lone worker assigned to a weekend shift at a mannequin manufacturing plant. Your routine seems straightforward: check emails, assemble parts, pack boxes, and load the truck. But it quickly becomes clear\u2014you\u2019re not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Work simulation gameplay</strong>: Use your computer, organize parts, and assemble full mannequins to complete delivery orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b <strong>Dynamic tension system</strong>: Scares and paranormal events escalate based on your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>Atmospheric horror</strong>: Low lighting, eerie audio design, and subtle environmental storytelling create constant unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Replayable scenarios</strong>: Orders and events are varied, ensuring different experiences on each playthrough.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670610?t=1768144982","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670610?t=1768144982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670610/a672e5f53c21af3c66380c2c4f5354ca498875af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768144982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670610/a672e5f53c21af3c66380c2c4f5354ca498875af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768144982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors